Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: contrib/visupng/VisualPng.c
Line: 109
Function: WinMain
Bug type: out-of-bounds-write
CWE: CWE-787
Explanation: Copies the command line into szCmdFileName using strncpy with length strlen(szCmdLine)-2 without bounding against MAX_PATH and without ensuring NUL-termination. A long or malformed (e.g., missing closing quote) command line can cause writing past the fixed-size szCmdFileName buffer.

